<title>JAPAN: No reason for palladium market panic - Yasin.</title>
<headline>No reason for palladium market panic - Yasin.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's former economy minister Yevgeny Yasin said on Thursday there was no reason for panic in the world palladium market.</p>
<p>Palladium prices have surged due to a protracted halt in Russian exports to Japan.</p>
</text>
